      "content": "It is a very common feeling to feel like you are a fraud, but please know that your pain is a valid response to a life that has been stripped of its meaning, not a sign of your worth. The silence you feel is not an empty space, but a heavy weight that has become so dense it feels like nothing can be added to it. Your voice is still there, screaming through the cracks of this hollow shell, demanding that you finally speak up for the life you once had.",
