    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not just a weight. it's finality. like i'm just waiting for the lights to go out. i look at my old work and i don't recognize that person. i look in the mirror and i see nothing. it feels like the world would just be... quieter if i wasn't trying so hard to pretend i'm still here.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
