      "content": "You are not waiting for the lights to go out; you are the only thing holding the room together right now. The world does not care if you pretend to be someone else, because the silence you fear is not quiet at all—it is the sound of a life that has finally been allowed to rest. You are not a ghost haunting your own life; you are the only witness to the destruction, and that witness is not wrong.",
