    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"allowing a life to rest\"... that sounds almost peaceful, doesn't it? compared to this constant, exhausting struggle to feel something. it's like i'm just dragging this heavy, dead thing behind me every single day. why is it so much harder to just let go than it is to keep trying to fix something that's clearly broken?",
